<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-E FEB GROUP NET AT PLN 4.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-E FEB GROUP NET AT PLN 4.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Group net profit	     4.33 vs   2.93</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 4.82 vs   3.41</p>
<p> Group operating profit     0.60 vs   2.40</p>
<p> Group sales		   34.13 vs  29.49</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Group net profit	     7.54 vs   5.64</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 8.53 vs   6.50</p>
<p> Group operating profit     1.53 vs   2.95</p>
<p> Group sales		   64.81 vs  55.88</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mosotostal Export SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
